{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE WOLF AND THE WARREN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584070/extras/Steam_Description_1.png?t=1742557888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sam Bane the Wolf is travelling across the country to start her new job in the big city. But, oh no, her car has broken\u00a0down on a remote forest road just as a storm rolls in over the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As luck would have it though, she's broken down close to the best kept secret in the woods; a quaint little roadside hotel called \u2018<i><strong>The Warren</strong></i>\u2019. Well, there\u2019s no escaping the storm at this rate, Sam\u2019s going to have to stay the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She quickly meets the Night Manager of her new lodgings, an adorable Bunny called \u2018Kylie\u2019 and the two become fast friends. Turns out, they're the only two patrons of the Hotel on this dark &amp; stormy night.... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What will happen as the pair ride out the storm in the safety and comfort of the Warren Hotel? Come and find out!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584070/extras/Steam_Description_2.png?t=1742557888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wolf and The Warren is A <strong><i>classic-style interactive visual novel</i></strong>. The games boasts a brand new and fully illustrated  story that takes you through our girl's seemingly perilous night together in the hotel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Wolf and The Warren Features</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Brand New\u00a0Erotic\u00a0 Storyline Full of Twists and Turns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful  2D Erotic Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expressive Character Artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated Scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Soundscapes and Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Replay Scenes with Full Image Galleries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Save/Load your Progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So sit back, relax and  discover what lies in store for the patrons of <strong>The Warren Hotel</strong> on this <i>fateful stormy night</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584070?t=1742557888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3584070?t=1742557888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584070/00fa029f275501ef4bf8ab97673bc47398cab027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742557888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584070/00fa029f275501ef4bf8ab97673bc47398cab027/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742557888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains explicit drawn sexual acts between all willing participants. "},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE WOLF AND THE WARREN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3584070/extras/Steam_Description_1.png?t=1742557888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sam Bane the Wolf is travelling across the country to start her new job in the big city. But, oh no, her car has broken\u00a0down on a remote forest road just as a storm rolls in over the mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As luck would have it though, she's broken down close to the best kept secret in the woods; a quaint li